volec edit replace NAME < new.vl                  replace an item\n\
volec edit insert --after|--before NAME < item.vl  add an item\n\
volec edit delete NAME                              remove an item\n\
volec edit wrap NAME --in unsafe [--lines A-B]      wrap a body or lines in a block\n\
volec edit new-file PATH < text                     a new file with its mod line\n\
