    Help { cmd: "rewrite", text: "volec rewrite 'grow($v, $n)' '$v.reserve($n)' --where '$v: &mut IntVec' --dry-run   an idiom everywhere, typed (--in FILE|MODULE|ITEM, repeated)\n\
  --list (PATTERN alone too): a line per site, what its holes matched; --where '$v: name ~ RE' or $v~/RE/: names only\n\
  --subst 'PATTERN' 'REPL': inside the code the holes keep; a hole the pattern lacks is a new name (`for $x in`)\n\
volec rewrite --text OLD NEW [--files GLOB]... --dry-run --diff   text in any file git tracks (0.21), one edit for undo\n\
  --word (no letter or digit around: VOLE_ROOT has VOLE), --case (any case; NEW in the match's), --regex (in a line)\n\
  --comments, --strings, --code: in vole sources only there; --no-sources: the other files; --move-paths: paths too (git mv)\n\
  --exclude GLOB | GLOB:/RE/ (lines) | GLOB:/A/,/B/ (A up to before B), --exclude-from FILE; --check ROOT: no new error\n" },
    Help { cmd: "fix", text: "volec fix   every machine-applicable fix: imports, unused, pub, unsafe\n\
  --suggested: the exact fixes the errors' `try: volec fix --suggested` names (a did-you-mean\n\
