    *r of an access -> r, let mut -> var, let r = &mut v -> inout r = &v, static var, sink ||, fields let T / inout T;\n\
    checked with --syntax=0.20; what needs a decision is reported (fix.conv_left; --list-left: each place)\n\
  --only conventions-spelling: only what Phase 0 means as 0.19 did (x: let T, &v and *r kept): checks and runs as before\n" },
    Help { cmd: "check", text: "volec check [ROOT]   the front end's errors, one line each (FILE:L:C: error[KIND] MESSAGE | help: ...); none: `ok: 0 errors in ROOT` on stderr (a build: `ok: built PROG`; VOLE_OK=0: nothing)\n" },
    Help {
        cmd: "fmt",
        text: "volec fmt FILE|MODULE   lay code out (--check, --dry-run; --all the tree)\n",
